    skos:scopeNote "A vessel or craft used for catching or harvesting marine life by a variety of methods, use specific method where known."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/eh_tmc/concepts/100487> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:altLabel "U Boot"@en,
