    skos:prefLabel "U Boat"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "The British designation for any German submarine built for military purposes. U-Boat is an anglicization of the German U-Boot, an abbreviation for Unterseeboot (Undersea Boat). In German U-Boot refers to any submarine."@en .

